4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"oyrz4wG_0cI2xStw8Ct22Q","review_id":"-LU8q0id3zbfIHRS_WmRLA","date":"2020-08-12T14:43:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9388971328735352,"text_excerpt":"J'ador Petite Rouge! Such a cute coffee spot, that I had NO CLUE existed until my friend introduced us on a rainy Sunday morning. This coffee spot has a few tables to utilize and all of the windows gives it such beautiful natural lighting. We had our coffees to go and the team was so friendly. They actually knew my friends order by heart, including his signature pastry of choice lol. I remember slurping down my coffee like it was water and really enjoyed it. I definitely can't wait to come back and actually sit in the shop. I'm like 1000% sure it's going to be amazing as well. They sell a few items from local vendors and they have a food menu as well. I also appreciate they have alternati..."},{"business_id":"oyrz4wG_0cI2xStw8Ct22Q","review_id":"XDxl0XWO4BHFvMtDB76wrg","date":"2019-02-12T20:48:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.931000828742981,"text_excerpt":"I had gone to the Petite Rouge truck on occasion so its good to see that they are now a bricks and mortar joint. The menu is expanded from the truck which is really good for this non-coffee drinker. There are 5 or 6 teas (but not a printed list that I saw) if you want hot. Iced, I think they offer a ginger and an herbal and a black. I went with the hot green which was delicious and OMG HOT. Like be careful and get an extra cup band hot. It's a great use of this under used building and VERY spacious. Bonus points for the series of popups in the back room!"},{"business_id":"oyrz4wG_0cI2xStw8Ct22Q","review_id":"zA4pPLUIb01cxcOwZSJ05Q","date":"2020-07-21T18:31:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9275866746902466,"text_excerpt":"I loooove this place! We just moved in down the street and needed a nearby place for our coffee fix since it would be so out of the way to go to District now. I didn't know what to expect from Petite Rouge and the killer experiences have made this place a permanent stop for us. Super friendly baristas and a heavily enforced mask mandate make this place a gem. If you enjoyed the Rocket Fuel from Dee's you'll love the Jet Fuel or Mocha Monster here. And never you worry, Petite Rouge makes its own syrups so if it's lavender you crave (and y'all know how I feel about District's lavender lattes!!!) they have lavender syrup too, along with ginger, maple, and BASIL. I want to try a new one every..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"oyrz4wG_0cI2xStw8Ct22Q","photo_id":"_LWT8oS24CbYX8-gLUdX2w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/_LWT8oS24CbYX8-gLUdX2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9156409502029419},{"business_id":"oyrz4wG_0cI2xStw8Ct22Q","photo_id":"iASZ0LMbVP6DkwpPiZa6Xg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/iASZ0LMbVP6DkwpPiZa6Xg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9053463935852051},{"business_id":"oyrz4wG_0cI2xStw8Ct22Q","photo_id":"F_feJc8eHeJ6oFkzP7P3xg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/F_feJc8eHeJ6oFkzP7P3xg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8619101047515869},{"business_id":"oyrz4wG_0cI2xStw8Ct22Q","photo_id":"pAQyfLRtBf_4gHaXzSQOdw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/pAQyfLRtBf_4gHaXzSQOdw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8331100940704346},